{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Job Matcher - hybrid score (0-100)\n**Candidate = your Master CV (Google Doc), read live each run.** Edit the CV → scoring updates automatically.\n**Rules (JS, 40 pts):** location 0-15 + seniority 0-25 → deterministic, explainable.\n**Gemini (60 pts):** skills match 0-40 + domain relevance 0-20 → structured JSON output.\nWhy hybrid: the LLM never decides the things a regex can decide, so scores don't drift.\nEvery 30 min, 8 jobs per run (stays inside Gemini free-tier limits, 7s gap between calls).\nOutput → JobsData: fit_score, verdict, top_skills, gaps, cv_angle, talking_points, status=matched/skipped.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "7572d901-f67a-46a5-89ac-7f3239431168",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
